{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1064003001:0":{"text":"Phew, we finally finished it off... Can't believe my explosive spell barely caused a dent in the sandworm's carapace...","source_cn":"总算解决了……沙虫铠甲好硬，爆炸魔法竟然都伤不到它……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5B46363BCA87CB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064003002:1":{"text":"You should never underestimate Setsahara, the king of Ashen Wastes.","source_cn":"毕竟是我们荒角沙漠的沙王——萨纳斯潘特。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9AA036FAC3B51C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064003003:1":{"text":"In the monster category, it's definitely the legendary kind.","source_cn":"也算是传说级别的怪物了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF09129948ED766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064003004:1":{"text":"What a cool name! Let me jot it down for future occasions.","source_cn":"好厉害的名字，可以记下来当命名参考。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB525689A1E1CFE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064003005:1":{"text":"...What kind of creature would need a name like that?","source_cn":"……什么东西才会用到这种名字啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4FF1ECA200EEE442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064003006:1":{"text":"Hello, newcomers!","source_cn":"嘿，你们好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6CF25B43D049DD55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064003007:1":{"text":"My name is Alsa, and he's Soren. Both of us are members of the Uru Clan.","source_cn":"我是阿尔萨，他是索恩！我们来自乌尔氏族！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3775674741BDC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064003008:1":{"text":"Magister Merlin, it's been so long! Are they your new companions?","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA169B288CEC631ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1064003008":{"text":"Magister Merlin, it's been so long! Are they your new companions?","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA169B288CEC631ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064003009:1":{"text":"A dungeon full of monsters? Wow, your world sounds awesome!","source_cn":"哇！另一个世界也太酷了！有迷宫和各种魔物啊……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BF317A9A000D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064003010:1":{"text":"What brings you to the Ashen Wastes?","source_cn":"你们怎么会来荒角沙漠？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xABE93E157D272C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064003011:1":{"text":"We're looking for ancient bones, which could help us get home.","source_cn":"我们来找远古生物骨骼，有了它说不定我们就能回去了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA929E05933B18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064003012:1":{"text":"You've come to the right place! We know just where the oldest bones lie, don't we, Soren?","source_cn":"那你们真是来对地方啦！我们知道哪里有最古老的骨骼，对吧...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064003013:1":{"text":"Yeah, Pops mentioned it before.","source_cn":"嗯，老爹提过。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A30A33452320430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064003014:1":{"text":"Now, why don't we split up? I'll bring you to the bones, while Soren—","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1064003014":{"text":"Now, why don't we split up? I'll bring you to the bones, while Soren—","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064003015:1":{"text":"Let's head back to our clan first then! We can feast on this huge sandworm.","source_cn":"那就先跟我们回部落里休整吧，正好尝尝这个大沙虫！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB9F03D07549C40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064003016:1":{"text":"But having said that, since it's our first time trying it too, I can't guarantee how it'll taste...","source_cn":"呃，不保证味道！因为我们也是第一次吃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7CED5A4E81F36F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064003017:0":{"text":"Is this your first time eating it too? I thought it was a common ingredient here...","source_cn":"你们没有吃过吗？我还以为这是这里常见的食物。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xED70AF30AAB4FF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064003018:1":{"text":"Well, sandworms are a tough nut to crack. We normally just steer clear of them.","source_cn":"不是啦，沙虫很难打的。一般我们都是躲着走。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF9468BC9608D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064003019:1":{"text":"It seems to be their mating season lately...","source_cn":"但最近似乎是沙虫的求偶期……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8270F3038493B055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064003020:0":{"text":"So they have been moving beyond their usual territory and growing more aggressive!","source_cn":"它的活动范围和脾气都变大了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4E819A1DA6D60380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064003021:0":{"text":"We wouldn't have survived earlier without you guys!","source_cn":"幸亏有你们在，不然我们肯定遭殃啦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAE13735E0F5278FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064003022:0":{"text":"It's getting hotter. We can talk as we go.","source_cn":"日头越来越大了，边走边说。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE60BD5F5514876C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:1064003023:1":{"text":"Together, you carry the massive sandworm back to the oasis of the Uru Clan. Senshi and Laios spend a long time examining the sandworm.","source_cn":"你们合力将巨大的沙虫运回了乌尔氏族的绿洲。森西和莱欧斯...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064003024:1":{"text":"This creature is truly a wonder. Though it lives in the desert, its carapace resembles that of a sea crustacean.","source_cn":"真是奇特的生物，生活在沙漠，但是外壳结构却像是甲壳类的...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064003025:1":{"text":"Hmm, with this body structure, maybe I can try sliding the knife in through the gaps in the shell...","source_cn":"那么，根据结构得在甲壳接缝处下刀，老夫先试试看……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x44C096E23863C40C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064003026:1":{"text":"After some precise cutting, Senshi carefully removes the sandworm's tough carapace.","source_cn":"森西沿着接缝巧妙地切割后，慢慢剥开了沙虫坚硬的外壳。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x57B7D25C60A58833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064003027:1":{"text":"Wow! There's white flesh inside!","source_cn":"哇！里面竟然是白色的肉！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x42CABC864566A6C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064003028:1":{"text":"And it looks so fresh and tender!","source_cn":"而且看起来好鲜嫩！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6434AD919BB9DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064003029:1":{"text":"The texture seems firm too, probably thanks to its frequent fast movement.","source_cn":"肉质看起来也很紧实。唔，或许跟它经常高速移动有关。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF55739E9A3C65E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064003030:1":{"text":"I'm wondering what it tastes like!","source_cn":"就是不知道尝起来什么味道？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1B71424F9AA5D7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064003031:1":{"text":"I've heard it tastes like somewhere between beef and chicken...","source_cn":"听说介于牛肉和鸡肉之间……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x00AEE61D0BAB0608","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064003032:1":{"text":"I'll dice the meat and make it into skewers. That way, we can taste its original flavor.","source_cn":"既然如此，那就切块做成肉串。这样能品尝到它最原始的味道。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8EC30A7EE2BB9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064003033:1":{"text":"Senshi, let me help!","source_cn":"森西，我也要切！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC26827A2E4AA4A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064003034:1":{"text":"I'll prepare some sandstone nut powder as seasoning.","source_cn":"那我去准备点盐津仁粉，作为撒料。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB12B8599E3C130AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064003035:1":{"text":"Hmm, what else... Ah, I can get some snakebone grass juice as a beverage!","source_cn":"嗯……那我去弄点蛇骨草水来，给大家解腻。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAE491C20E0889352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064003036:1":{"text":"Is that a plant? I'd like to take a look!","source_cn":"蛇骨草，是植物吗？我有点想看看！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x48150EE255B0E089","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064003037:1":{"text":"Chippy and I can pitch in!","source_cn":"我和满满也去帮忙！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA339FD3ED0A42B1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064003038:1":{"text":"...Why am I left all alone again?","source_cn":"……怎么又只剩下我了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xACF730C93407EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:57:1064003038":{"text":"...Why am I left all alone again?","source_cn":"……怎么又只剩下我了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xACF730C93407EB14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064003039:1":{"text":"Let me see if there's anything I can do...","source_cn":"只能看看有没有什么力所能及的活了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x06982B819FA26DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064003040:1":{"text":"Hmm, then I'll start getting the campfire ready.","source_cn":"唔，那我们去准备篝火吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC013779114FAB227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064003041:1":{"text":"And with that, everyone jumps into action with great enthusiasm.","source_cn":"就这样，大家热火朝天地忙了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x62A2FBEC449DA4E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064003042:1":{"text":"Soon, the <style=\"highlight\">sandworm skewers</style> and <style=\"highlight\">snakebone grass juice</style> are ready.","source_cn":"很快地，<style=highlight>盐津仁沙虫肉...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:62::2":{"text":"Sandworm Skewers & Snakebone Grass Juice","source_cn":"盐津仁沙虫肉串与荒角蛇骨草水","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BF1920F8017E516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064003043:0":{"text":"This is my first time preparing a sandworm dish. Go ahead and try it.","source_cn":"老夫也是第一次料理沙虫肉，各位先尝尝看吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4B84EE6F4FF6ACC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064003044:1":{"text":"Mmm... delicious!","source_cn":"唔……好吃！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB5186E5231521044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064003045:1":{"text":"It's crispy outside and tender inside! The juicy meat tastes sweeter than beef and more tender than chicken!","source_cn":"外脆里嫩，肉质紧实又多汁！越嚼越多汁。比牛肉多了一丝甜...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064003046:1":{"text":"This is insane. How could an insect possibly taste like chicken or beef?","source_cn":"怎么想都很奇怪？虫肉怎么会像鸡肉和牛肉……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5241D590BB4F31A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:71:1064003046":{"text":"This is insane. How could an insect possibly taste like chicken or beef?","source_cn":"怎么想都很奇怪？虫肉怎么会像鸡肉和牛肉……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5241D590BB4F31A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064003047:1":{"text":"... Guess I'll start with some snakebone grass juice first. If I'm still hungry later, I'll give it a go...","source_cn":"……我还是先喝蛇骨草水吧。实在饿了……我再尝尝看！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x88C40CA90AF7BF6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064003048:0":{"text":"It's best to eat it while it's hot.","source_cn":"肉要趁热吃。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD7200FF073DC78F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064003049:0":{"text":"Alright, I'll eat it now...","source_cn":"呜，我知道啦。我现在就吃——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x94BF7F85C75B0EEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064003050:1":{"text":"Mmm, so delicious! It melts in my mouth but isn't greasy at all!","source_cn":"好、好吃！入口即化，但又不腻！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95930FF7E0F8C962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064003051:1":{"text":"Eating meat by a bonfire... We haven't had such a good time in ages.","source_cn":"在篝火旁吃肉串……好久没有那么悠闲了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6C21031F0F86B42B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064003052:1":{"text":"I'd like some alcohol, but there are only children in this clan, after all.","source_cn":"虽说这时候应该配上一杯酒，但这个部落里都是小孩子。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC814614C2857C31A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064003053:1":{"text":"Might not be appropriate from an educational standpoint...","source_cn":"还是不要教坏他们了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA7987B6F6E802871","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064003054:1":{"text":"Do you always enjoy delicious food like this in the dungeon?","source_cn":"你们在迷宫里也能吃到这么美味的食物吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBBD2E57766302896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064003055:1":{"text":"We do, thanks to Senshi!","source_cn":"当然了，这都多亏了森西！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x61E9C4A1DCB86140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064003056:1":{"text":"Having a proper meal is always more important than anything else, no matter where we are.","source_cn":"老夫只是觉得……无论身在哪里，吃好饭都是很重要的事情。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x48F58DED1C238222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:87:1064003057:1":{"text":"By the bonfire, you enjoy a delicious feast and share your past adventures until late into the night...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:71:0:1":{"text":"You never know until you try.","source_cn":"尝了才知道，不如先试试？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE19C2AC31FAFCDB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You never know until you try.","female":"You never know until you try.","variant_male_record_index":"59940","variant_female_record_index":"59941","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:57:0:1":{"text":"I'm here too.","source_cn":"还有我","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x987F019817D3F75F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm here too.","female":"I'm here too.","variant_male_record_index":"59938","variant_female_record_index":"59939","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"We should search at night.","source_cn":"别急，骨骼得在夜晚获得","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3232009CCD40255","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We should search at night.","female":"We should search at night.","variant_male_record_index":"59936","variant_female_record_index":"59937","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"(Introduce both parties)","source_cn":"（帮他们互相介绍了一番）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70E33934842242E4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Introduce both parties)","female":"(Introduce both parties)","variant_male_record_index":"59934","variant_female_record_index":"59935","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:玛露西尔":{"text":"Marcille","source":"玛露西尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matc